# The runtime corpus is regenerated by `cargo test` (one module per runtime subsystem); ci/out keeps
# the benchmark report and the examples' IR, which the CI job commits.
/ci/out/runtime-corpus/

# Local scratch space (leak-hunting harnesses, repro cases, the sandbox toolchain). Never committed.
# `.work/env.sh` rebuilds it from scratch, so nothing here is worth keeping in history.
/.work/

# Compiled binaries are build output, never source. The root-level names below were committed by
# mistake once (AX-005) and are ignored by name as well as by the CI binary scan.
/bw
/call_and_loop_semantics
/d1
/full_tour_pythonic
/hello
/pipelines

# Stray build outputs from ad-hoc runs
/W1
/W2
/W3
/ax001-tmp

# Python bytecode from the repo's tools/ scripts.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
